1
00:00:00,309 --> 00:00:02,229
(Leonard:)You're right, it is simple.

2
00:00:07,649 --> 00:00:09,649
- Hey, Sheldon.
SHELDON: Penny.

3
00:00:09,818 --> 00:00:12,818
(Penny:)Third floor tonight. Mixing it up?

4
00:00:14,031 --> 00:00:15,281
(Sheldon:)Oh.

5
00:00:16,533 --> 00:00:19,493
(Penny:)I still don't understand
why you don't just go to dinner.

6
00:00:19,661 --> 00:00:22,041
All right, let's say I go to dinner alone...

7
00:00:22,205 --> 00:00:24,495
(Sheldon:)...and during the meal
I have to use the restroom.

8
00:00:24,666 --> 00:00:27,756
(Sheldon:)How do I know
someone's not touching my food?

9
00:00:31,089 --> 00:00:33,089
Good night, Sheldon.

10
00:00:33,258 --> 00:00:35,298
(Sheldon:)Penny, hold on.

11
00:00:35,844 --> 00:00:38,264
(Sheldon:)You sure things can't work out
with you and Leonard?

12
00:00:38,430 --> 00:00:39,470
(Penny:)Excuse me?

13
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:43,520
(Sheldon:)I'm just wondering
if you really gave it the old college try.

14
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:47,690
(Sheldon:)Or in your case,
the old community-college try.

15
00:00:49,483 --> 00:00:51,773
(Penny:)Okay, where is this coming from?

16
00:00:52,402 --> 00:00:55,782
(Sheldon:)Leonard is upstairs right now
with my archenemy.

17
00:00:55,948 --> 00:01:00,198
- Your archenemy?
- Yes, the Dr. Doom to my Mr. Fantastic.

